NCLUDING $3.6 BILLION CONTRACTUAL SALE OF GAS PROJECT BACKLOG.Q2 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WERE $1.90, 4% ABOVE PRIOR YEAR, OR 8% HIGHER WHEN EXCLUDING NEGATIVE CURRENCY TRANSLATION EFFECTS.SECOND-QUARTER OPERATING PROFIT WAS $591 MILLION."}{'symbol': 'LYV', 'date': '2020-07-31 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Live Nation Enhances Flexibility With Credit Agreement Amendment', 'text': "LIVE NATION ENHANCES FLEXIBILITY WITH CREDIT AGREEMENT AMENDMENT.LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT INC - AMENDMENT EXTENDS TIME PERIOD DURING WHICH LIVE NATION'S MAINTENANCE COVENANT WILL FOCUS ON LIQUIDITY METRICS.LIVE NATION ENTERTAINMENT INC - LENDERS HAVE AGREED TO FURTHER SUSPEND LIVE NATION'S NET LEVERAGE COVENANT UNTIL DECEMBER 31, 2021."}{'symbol': 'MA', 'date': '2020-07-31 20:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Mastercard Says In June 2020, FTC Informed Co That It Has Initiated Formal Investigation Into Compliance With Durbin Amendment', 'text': "MASTERCARD SAYS IN JUNE 2020, FTC INFORMED CO THAT IT HAS INITIATED FORMAL INVESTIGATION INTO COMPLIANCE WITH DURBIN AMENDMENT - SEC FILING.MASTERCARD INC FTC SAYS HAS ISSUED SUBPOENA AND MASTERCARD IS COOPERATING WITH IT IN INVESTIGATION.MASTERCARD INC SAYS FTC INVESTIGATION FOCUSES ON CO'S COMPLIANCE WITH DEBIT ROUTING PROVISIONS OF DURBIN AMENDMENT."}{'symbol': 'MRK', 'date': '2020-07-31 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Merck Announces Q2 Non-Gaap Earnings Per Share $1.37', 'text': "MERCK ANNOUNCES SECOND-QUARTER 2020 FINANCIAL RESULTS.Q2 NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.37.Q2 GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $1.18.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $1.04 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.COMPANY NARROWS AND RAISES 2020 FULL-YEAR REVENUE RANGE TO BE BETWEEN $47.2 BILLION AND $48.7 BILLION.COMPANY NARROWS AND RAISES 2020 FULL-YEAR GAAP EPS RANGE TO BE BETWEEN $4.58 AND $4.73.QTRLY KEYTRUDA SALES GREW 29% TO $3.4 BILLION.NARROWS AND RAISES 2020 FULL-YEAR NON-GAAP EPS RANGE TO BE BETWEEN $5.63 AND $5.78.SECOND-QUARTER 2020 WORLDWIDE SALES WERE $10.9 BILLION, A DECREASE OF 8%.Q2 REVENUE VIEW $10.39 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QTRLY JANUVIA / JANUMET SALES $1.34 BILLION VERSUS $1.44 BILLION REPORTED LAST YEAR.QTRLY GARDASIL / GARDASIL 9 SALES $656 MILLION VERSUS $886 MILLION REPORTED LAST YEAR.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $5.31, REVENUE VIEW $47.33 BILLION -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.V591 IS CURRENTLY IN PRECLINICAL DEVELOPMENT AND CLINICAL STUDIES ARE PLANNED TO START IN Q3.V590 IS CURRENTLY IN PRECLINICAL DEVELOPMENT AND CLINICAL STUDIES ARE PLANNED TO START THIS YEAR..IN Q2, ESTIMATED OVERALL NEGATIVE IMPACT OF COVID-19 PANDEMIC TO MERCK'S REVENUE WAS APPROXIMATELY $1.6 BILLION.FOR 2020, NOW EXPECTS UNFAVORABLE IMPACT TO REVENUE OF ABOUT $1.95 BILLION (EXCLUDING IMPACT OF FOREIGN EXCHANGE) DUE TO COVID-19 PANDEMIC."}{'symbol': 'MTD', 'date': '2020-07-31 18:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Mettler-Toledo Q2 Earnings Per Share $5.22', 'text': '. REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2020 RESULTS.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE $5.22.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $4.20 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.Q2 ADJUSTED NON-GAAP EARNINGS PER SHARE $5.29.METTLER-TOLEDO INTERNATIONAL - FOR Q3 2020 ESTIMATES THAT LOCAL CURRENCY SALES WILL DECLINE ABOUT DOWN 1% TO DOWN 3%.FOR Q3 2020 ADJUSTED EPS IS FORECASTED TO BE IN RANGE OF $5.80 TO $6.00.METTLER-TOLEDO INTERNATIONAL - FOR FULL YEAR 2020, ESTIMATES THAT LOCAL CURRENCY SALES WILL DECLINE ABOUT DOWN 1% TO DOWN 3%.METTLER-TOLEDO INTERNATIONAL - FOR FULL YEAR 2020 ADJUSTED EPS IS FORECASTED TO BE IN RANGE OF $22.70 TO $23.20.Q3 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $5.06 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.FY2020 EARNINGS PER SHARE VIEW $21.22 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.'}{'symbol': 'MGM', 'date': '2020-07-31 21:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'MGM Resorts International Reports Q2 Loss Per Share $1.67', 'text': 'QTRLY ADJUSTED LOSS PER SHARE (NOT GAAP LOSS PER SHARE) $1.52.REPORTS SECOND QUARTER FINANCIAL AND OPERATING RESULTS.Q2 LOSS PER SHARE $1.67.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $-1.69 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.LIQUIDITY POSITION REMAINS STRONG AMID CURRENT CRISIS.QTRLY CONSOLIDATED NET REVENUES